OL,3,GNEWSAMahmood urged not to merge        
OL,4,ALondon's police forces                 
OL,6,FThe mayor of London and the political  
OL,7,Fhead of the City of London Corporation 
OL,8,Fhave joined forces to oppose any plan  
OL,9,Fto merge the Metropolitan Police and   
OL,10,FCity of London Police.                 
OL,12,FLord Khan and Deputy Chris Hayward said
OL,13,Fin their letter sent to Home Secretary,
OL,14,FShabana Mahmood that retaining separate
OL,15,Fservices for the Square Mile and the   
OL,16,Fwider capital was "best for London and 
OL,17,Fthe rest of the country".              
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
