OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMahmood urged not to merge        
OL,4,ALondon's police forces                 
OL,6,FThe pair's joint stance contrasts with 
OL,7,Fthat of Metropolitan Police            
OL,8,FCommissioner Sir Mark Rowley, who      
OL,9,Fadvocated for the merger as part of    
OL,10,Fwidespread reforms to forces in England
OL,11,Fand Wales.                             
OL,13,FA Home Office spokesperson said the    
OL,14,Fcurrent model of policing was "not fit 
OL,15,Ffor purpose".                          
